{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "35612162231761847", "organization": {"id": "143292931875082", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "35612162231761847"}]}, "id": "1290988049849886"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "35612162231761847", "release_date": 1779987240, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "38236611132650264"}, "id": "3016977871841135"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1789038479, "id": "38236312859346758", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v4", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 4, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "38376442085333834"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "35612162231761847"}, "id": "38376442085333834", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "35612162231761847", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1180013304210755"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2211671509382014", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Escape the Urban Underground", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**\u6b22\u8fce\u8e0f\u5165\u9ed1\u6697**\n**\u6211\u4eec\u4e3a\u4f60\u5e26\u6765\u4e00\u573a\u6050\u6016\u4e14\u6781\u5177\u6c89\u6d78\u611f\u7684\u5bc6\u5ba4\u9003\u8131\u4f53\u9a8c**\uff0c\u6311\u6218\u4f60\u7684\u89c2\u5bdf\u529b\u3001\u903b\u8f91\u601d\u7ef4\u548c\u5fc3\u7406\u6781\u9650\u3002\u5728\u7e41\u534e\u57ce\u5e02\u7684\u5730\u4e0b\u6df1\u5904\uff0c\u9690\u85cf\u7740\u4e00\u5ea7\u88ab\u9057\u5fd8\u7684\u5730\u94c1\u7ad9\uff0c\u5b83\u5df2\u7ecf\u4e0e\u5916\u754c\u9694\u7edd\u4e86\u6570\u5341\u5e74\u3002\u7834\u8d25\u7684\u7ad9\u53f0\u4e0a\u521a\u521a\u53d1\u751f\u4e86\u4e00\u8d77\u9a87\u4eba\u7684\u8c0b\u6740\u6848\uff0c\u4f46\u4f60\u5f88\u5feb\u5c31\u4f1a\u53d1\u73b0\u2014\u2014\u8fd9\u91cc\u5e76\u4e0d\u53ea\u6709\u4f60\u4e00\u4e2a\u4eba\u3002\n\n**\u9009\u62e9\u5c5e\u4e8e\u4f60\u7684\u6311\u6218\u65b9\u5f0f**\nEscape the Urban Underground \u4fdd\u7559\u4e86\u5176**\u7ecf\u5178\u7684 60 \u5206\u949f\u6311\u6218\u6a21\u5f0f**\uff0c\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u573a\u4e13\u4e3a\u5355\u6b21\u7d27\u5f20\u6e38\u620f\u4f53\u9a8c\u800c\u8bbe\u8ba1\u7684\u5bc6\u5ba4\u9003\u8131\u6311\u6218\u3002\u5728\u8be5\u6a21\u5f0f\u4e2d\uff0c\u5f53\u4f60\u8e0f\u5165\u8f66\u7ad9\u7684\u90a3\u4e00\u523b\uff0c\u5012\u8ba1\u65f6\u5c31\u4f1a\u5f00\u59cb\uff1a\u4f60\u5fc5\u987b\u4e32\u8054\u6240\u6709\u7ebf\u7d22\u3001\u7834\u89e3\u8c0b\u6740\u6848\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u65f6\u95f4\u8017\u5c3d\u4e4b\u524d\u627e\u5230\u51fa\u53e3\u3002\u6210\u529f\u5b8c\u6210\u5168\u90e8\u5185\u5bb9\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\u901a\u5e38\u9700\u8981\u8fdb\u884c\u591a\u6b21\u5c1d\u8bd5\uff0c\u7d2f\u8ba1\u6295\u5165 **120 \u81f3 240 \u5206\u949f\u7684\u8c03\u67e5\u65f6\u95f4**\uff0c\u624d\u80fd\u771f\u6b63\u638c\u63e1\u8f66\u7ad9\u4e2d\u7684\u6240\u6709\u79d8\u5bc6\u3002\n\n\u73b0\u5728\uff0c\u4f60\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u9009\u62e9 **Relaxed \u6a21\u5f0f**\u3002\u8be5\u6a21\u5f0f\u9002\u5408\u5e0c\u671b\u6309\u7167\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8282\u594f\u8c03\u67e5\u8f66\u7ad9\u548c\u7834\u89e3\u8c1c\u9898\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u5fc5\u5728\u4e00\u6b21\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u5b8c\u6210\u5168\u90e8\u4f53\u9a8c\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\u3002Relaxed \u6a21\u5f0f\u63d0\u4f9b**\u68c0\u67e5\u70b9\u81ea\u52a8\u4fdd\u5b58\u4ee5\u53ca\u7ee7\u7eed\u6e38\u620f\u529f\u80fd**\uff0c\u8ba9\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u968f\u65f6\u9000\u51fa\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u4e4b\u540e\u7ee7\u7eed\u8c03\u67e5\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u4f1a\u4e22\u5931\u8fdb\u5ea6\u3002\n\n\u9009\u62e9\u6743\u5728\u4f60\u624b\u4e2d\uff1a\u6311\u6218\u539f\u7248\u7684\u9650\u65f6\u9003\u8131\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u6309\u7167\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8282\u594f\u6df1\u5165\u8c1c\u56e2\u3002\n\n**\u4e13\u4e3a VR \u6253\u9020\u7684\u52a8\u6001\u8c1c\u9898**\n\u8fd1\u8ddd\u79bb\u63a2\u7d22\u4e00\u4e2a\u4e13\u4e3a\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\u6253\u9020\u7684\u8be1\u5f02\u73af\u5883\u3002\u4ed4\u7ec6\u8c03\u67e5\u73b0\u573a\uff0c\u6062\u590d\u9508\u8ff9\u6591\u6591\u7684\u4ea4\u901a\u7ec8\u7aef\u4f9b\u7535\uff0c\u7834\u89e3\u795e\u79d8\u7684\u51e0\u4f55\u5b89\u5168\u9762\u677f\uff0c\u5e76\u7a7f\u8d8a\u72ed\u7a84\u3001\u9634\u68ee\u4e14\u5806\u6ee1\u6b8b\u9ab8\u7684\u5730\u94c1\u8f66\u53a2\u3002\u6bcf\u4e00\u9053\u8c1c\u9898\u90fd\u9700\u8981\u5b9e\u9645\u64cd\u4f5c\u3001\u654f\u9510\u89c2\u5bdf\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u5728\u538b\u529b\u4e0b\u8fc5\u901f\u601d\u8003\u7684\u80fd\u529b\u3002\n\n**\u4f60\u80fd\u53d1\u73b0\u8fd9\u91cc\u7a76\u7adf\u53d1\u751f\u4e86\u4ec0\u4e48\u5417\uff1f**\n\u8f66\u7ad9\u7684\u6bcf\u4e00\u4e2a\u89d2\u843d\u90fd\u53ef\u80fd\u9690\u85cf\u7740\u65b0\u7684\u7ebf\u7d22\u3002\u89c2\u5bdf\u3001\u5c1d\u8bd5\u3001\u5c06\u788e\u7247\u9010\u4e00\u62fc\u63a5\uff0c\u5e76\u4e00\u6b65\u6b65\u63a5\u8fd1\u771f\u76f8\u3002\u8c0b\u6740\u6848\uff0c\u53ea\u662f\u8fd9\u4e00\u5207\u7684\u5f00\u59cb\u3002", "short_description": "\u300aEscape the Urban Underground\u300b\u5e26\u6765\u4e00\u573a\u6050\u6016\u4e14\u6781\u5177\u6c89\u6d78\u611f\u7684 VR \u5bc6\u5ba4\u9003\u8131\u4f53\u9a8c\uff0c\u5c06\u4f60\u7684\u601d\u7ef4\u4e0e\u80c6\u91cf\u63a8\u5411\u6781\u9650\u3002\u7e41\u534e\u90fd\u5e02\u7684\u5730\u4e0b\u6df1\u5904\uff0c\u9690\u85cf\u7740\u4e00\u5ea7\u4e0e\u5916\u754c\u9694\u7edd\u7684\u5e9f\u5f03\u5730\u94c1\u7ad9\u3002\u4e00\u573a\u9a87\u4eba\u7684\u8c0b\u6740\u521a\u521a\u53d1\u751f\u5728\u8fd9\u4e9b\u7834\u8d25\u7684\u7ad9\u53f0\u4e0a\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Sin t\u00edtulo-3_grande.png", "id": "1876635376337167", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1876635379670500_4308229000641340391_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zj_LWeVfJDkQ7kNvwFkFInG&_nc_oc=AdqTz8OP8O5sCu4JJqu3VT4O3MBrpGqJ5Vhusk0CZ1qqfWOcHUKwfsBiymnF_7rJtB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLxKx_0Jrer_FM5n3O-ilpUXKFjsMi19gU2Szin2MZ8lQ&oe=6AB90A4A"}, {"file_name": "ImagenPost.png", "id": "1709326093438054", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1709326096771387_7230375159379753215_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5RyjCtglna0Q7kNvwGKonfe&_nc_oc=Adoba4GMqqZRxsCMm87Ry_lvT25tlf5gQmWvbHnzbPooOWoa4LRnOODdscWB55O5MLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ2uAs6alfx4BLywj8o_5yAnLTOtiRMa9Qr81KZMdyJlA&oe=6AB91639"}, {"file_name": "Imagen3.png", "id": "1556788282772082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_1556788286105415_4984410497413346481_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A2ocVvIdRMoQ7kNvwF5UoVU&_nc_oc=Adp02ST0vCl1rElwDWTCn0E5--_qqsVFRiSIX8BtGMdf-vhso-uO7pMoFS7RdGAA36Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIp27UL2qlgVTPDefSs9jUylWktObeqVyNiAULxjB9wKw&oe=6AB916F8"}]}, "id": "1489625443071427", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Escape the Urban Underground.", "keywords": ["SalaDeEscape", "EscapeRoom", "ScapeRoom", "Misterio", "AcertijosYPuzzles"], "long_description": "**Bienvenido a las sombras**\n\nEscape the Urban Underground es un escape room de realidad virtual terror\u00edfico e inmersivo. Bajo la ciudad se oculta una estaci\u00f3n de metro olvidada, aislada durante d\u00e9cadas. Un espantoso asesinato acaba de ocurrir en sus andenes en ruinas, pero pronto descubrir\u00e1s que no est\u00e1s solo.\n\n{1876635376337167}\n\n**Elige tu desaf\u00edo**\n\nAfronta el desaf\u00edo original de 60 minutos: conecta las pistas, resuelve el asesinato y encuentra la salida antes de que se agote el tiempo, en una \u00fanica e intensa partida.\n\nO elige el modo Relaxed, sin l\u00edmite global de tiempo. El guardado autom\u00e1tico mediante puntos de control y la opci\u00f3n Continuar te permiten salir de la partida y retomar la investigaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s tarde sin perder el progreso guardado. No necesitas completar toda la experiencia en una sola sesi\u00f3n.\n\n{1709326093438054}\n\n**Puzles dise\u00f1ados para VR**\n\nExplora la estaci\u00f3n, examina objetos de cerca e interact\u00faa con un entorno espeluznante creado para la realidad virtual. Restaura la energ\u00eda de terminales oxidados, descifra paneles de seguridad geom\u00e9tricos y avanza por vagones claustrof\u00f3bicos llenos de escombros. Cada puzle exige l\u00f3gica pr\u00e1ctica y observaci\u00f3n.\n\n{1556788282772082}\n\n**Descubre la verdad**\n\nCada rinc\u00f3n puede esconder una pista. Observa, experimenta y conecta las piezas para descubrir qu\u00e9 ocurri\u00f3 realmente. El asesinato es solo el principio.", "short_description": "Escape the Urban Underground es un escape room de realidad virtual terror\u00edfico e inmersivo. Explora una estaci\u00f3n de metro olvidada bajo la ciudad e investiga el espantoso asesinato ocurrido en sus andenes en ruinas."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1400774982197320", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Escape the Urban Underground", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Willkommen in den Schatten**\n\nEscape the Urban Underground ist ein furchteinfl\u00f6\u00dfendes, immersives VR-Escape-Room-Erlebnis. Tief unter der Stadt liegt eine vergessene U-Bahn-Station, seit Jahrzehnten von der Au\u00dfenwelt abgeschnitten. Auf ihren verfallenen Bahnsteigen ist ein Mord geschehen \u2013 und du bist nicht allein.\n\n**W\u00e4hle deine Herausforderung**\n\nStelle dich der urspr\u00fcnglichen 60-Minuten-Herausforderung: Verbinde die Hinweise, kl\u00e4re den Mord auf und finde den Ausgang, bevor die Zeit abl\u00e4uft \u2013 in einer einzigen intensiven Sitzung.\n\nOder w\u00e4hle den Relaxed-Modus ohne \u00fcbergreifendes Zeitlimit. Automatisches Speichern an Checkpoints und die Fortsetzen-Funktion erlauben dir, das Spiel zu verlassen und deine Ermittlungen sp\u00e4ter fortzusetzen, ohne deinen gespeicherten Fortschritt zu verlieren. Du musst nicht alles in einer Sitzung abschlie\u00dfen.\n\n**R\u00e4tsel f\u00fcr VR**\n\nErkunde die Station, untersuche Objekte aus n\u00e4chster N\u00e4he und interagiere direkt mit einer unheimlichen VR-Umgebung. Versorge verrostete Terminals mit Strom, entschl\u00fcssle geometrische Sicherheitstafeln und bahne dir den Weg durch enge, mit Tr\u00fcmmern gef\u00fcllte Waggons. Jedes R\u00e4tsel erfordert praktische Logik und genaue Beobachtung.\n\n**Entdecke die Wahrheit**\n\nJede Ecke kann einen Hinweis verbergen. Beobachte, experimentiere und setze die Teile zusammen, um herauszufinden, was wirklich geschehen ist. Der Mord ist nur der Anfang.", "short_description": "Escape the Urban Underground ist ein furchteinfl\u00f6\u00dfendes, immersives VR-Escape-Room-Erlebnis. Tief unter der Stadt liegt eine vergessene U-Bahn-Station. Auf ihren verfallenen Bahnsteigen hat sich gerade ein grausamer Mord ereignet."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1064919192990706", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Escape the Urban Underground", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Bienvenue dans les t\u00e9n\u00e8bres**\n\nEscape the Urban Underground est un escape room VR terrifiant et immersif. Sous la ville se cache une station de m\u00e9tro oubli\u00e9e, coup\u00e9e du monde depuis des d\u00e9cennies. Un horrible meurtre vient d\u2019avoir lieu sur ses quais en ruine, mais vous d\u00e9couvrirez bient\u00f4t que vous n\u2019\u00eates pas seul.\n\n**Choisissez votre d\u00e9fi**\n\nRelevez le d\u00e9fi original de 60 minutes : reliez les indices, r\u00e9solvez le meurtre et trouvez la sortie avant la fin du temps imparti, en une seule session intense.\n\nOu choisissez le mode Relaxed, sans limite de temps globale. La sauvegarde automatique aux points de contr\u00f4le et l\u2019option Continuer vous permettent de quitter la partie et de reprendre votre enqu\u00eate plus tard sans perdre votre progression sauvegard\u00e9e. Vous n\u2019avez pas \u00e0 terminer toute l\u2019exp\u00e9rience en une seule session.\n\n**Des \u00e9nigmes con\u00e7ues pour la VR**\n\nExplorez la station, examinez les objets de pr\u00e8s et interagissez directement avec un environnement inqui\u00e9tant cr\u00e9\u00e9 pour la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle. R\u00e9tablissez l\u2019alimentation de terminaux rouill\u00e9s, d\u00e9chiffrez des panneaux de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 g\u00e9om\u00e9triques et traversez des wagons claustrophobiques encombr\u00e9s de d\u00e9bris. Chaque \u00e9nigme exige logique et observation.\n\n**D\u00e9couvrez la v\u00e9rit\u00e9**\n\nChaque recoin peut cacher un indice. Observez, exp\u00e9rimentez et assemblez les pi\u00e8ces du puzzle pour comprendre ce qui s\u2019est r\u00e9ellement pass\u00e9. Le meurtre n\u2019est que le commencement.", "short_description": "Escape the Urban Underground est un escape room VR terrifiant et immersif. Sous la ville se cache une station de m\u00e9tro oubli\u00e9e, coup\u00e9e du monde. Un meurtre atroce vient d\u2019avoir lieu sur ses quais en ruine."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImagenPost.png", "id": "2333586823832845", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_2333586830499511_4281950547705139550_n.png?_n